      </div>
      <div class="st-svc">
        <h3>Field &amp; wildlife monitoring</h3>
        <p>Drones, flight planning and species detection, built for remote sites with little power or bandwidth.</p>
        <div class="st-tools">Drones · YOLO · Blender sim</div>
      </div>
      <div class="st-svc">
        <h3>Applied AI</h3>
        <p>Models and LLM agents wired into the product, with evaluation so you know how well they work.</p>
